[{:db/id "q-121245/selection/a3c72559d7d25083af41603553dab28f112bf464761c0eb8d3b6e870c70cfb9e" :answer/id #uuid "aa20a189-08b6-59be-9313-9f5ede4f0cac" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $-$ | $+$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $-$ | $+$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121245/selection/e4d5cbdd1dc7cc0dd0fdf2a9056c717b9f60123484c35fc7a65c937abab9db2f" :answer/id #uuid "d4a34238-6ec6-5cd2-a195-c1e85bd672f8" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $+$ | $-$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $+$ | $-$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121245/selection/c8a570a7a45299d6bca7534749498af91d95f2281bdd8454030e707cf44ee838" :answer/id #uuid "f92b37f7-e41b-531d-80cb-923fa65320dc" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $+$ | $+$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $-$ | $-$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121245/selection/6ec7f55390e84a805c2f4b28c93f893967d5f7a64eeb901750d34dda29cf16f4" :answer/id #uuid "98b24376-b28b-5c3d-8a24-9727e81a7e6e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $-$ | $-$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $+$ | $+$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121245/selection/8aeecd39a62f0e7e086a13b8dc6247818469757a2ad4c68d10219db33e06a8ac" :answer/id #uuid "1203eec8-c056-5265-961f-3ec5b0008efb" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $-$ | $-$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $-$ | $-$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121245/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7feb64ef-cf61-5fbb-9859-6d9bff5ee8c0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-121245/selection/8aeecd39a62f0e7e086a13b8dc6247818469757a2ad4c68d10219db33e06a8ac" :answer-field/choices ["q-121245/selection/a3c72559d7d25083af41603553dab28f112bf464761c0eb8d3b6e870c70cfb9e" "q-121245/selection/e4d5cbdd1dc7cc0dd0fdf2a9056c717b9f60123484c35fc7a65c937abab9db2f" "q-121245/selection/c8a570a7a45299d6bca7534749498af91d95f2281bdd8454030e707cf44ee838" "q-121245/selection/6ec7f55390e84a805c2f4b28c93f893967d5f7a64eeb901750d34dda29cf16f4" "q-121245/selection/8aeecd39a62f0e7e086a13b8dc6247818469757a2ad4c68d10219db33e06a8ac"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-121245" :question/id #uuid "20133c72-91cf-5ba5-abff-91dc4da09230" :question/math-academy-id "q-121245" :question/problem "Consider the expression $f(x,y)=-2{x}^{2}{y}^{2}.$ What are the missing entries in the following sign table of $f(x,y)?$\n\n| $y>0$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $y<0$ |  |  |\n|  | $x<0$ | $x>0$ |" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $f(x,y)$ equals zero when $x=0$ and $y=0.$ These lines divide the $xy$-plane into four regions, as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040514/assets/c35c98904d2a0d0d6d49c582cd9f9dba9d96e91ae0da5deb2d329f38f77532e3.png)\n\nTo determine the sign of $f(x,y)$ in each region, we pick four test points, one for each region.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040514/assets/9340582eaad37c4ce1e0c8cbcdce48faec1e36c3c05adbedd61aa2de7168fd2f.png)\n\nNext, we calculate the sign of $f(x,y)$ in each region using a sign table:\n\n|  | Test point | $-2{x}^{2}$ | ${y}^{2}$ | $f(x,y)$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Top-Left | $(-1,1)$ | $-$ | $+$ | $-$ |\n| Top-Right | $(1,1)$ | $-$ | $+$ | $-$ |\n| Bottom-Left | $(-1,-1)$ | $-$ | $+$ | $-$ |\n| Bottom-Right | $(1,-1)$ | $-$ | $+$ | $-$ |\n\n \nUsing the *last* column of the table above, we get the following picture:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040514/assets/692942228da99b0e5e871d8b293009d9226f900df417a20f7035f7bab5ae3a63.png)\n\nFinally, we fill in the required sign table.\n\n| $y>0$ | $-$ | $-$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $y<0$ | $-$ | $-$ |\n|  | $x<0$ | $x>0$ |" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-121245/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "798800a5-255a-5738-91d2-21c2a78e4fb5"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-121245"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-149597/selection/bab4acf5ca3a66ed4f11bbcf7574627e6848417923ee89f9393917451c190309" :answer/id #uuid "5b5627c6-9422-5073-9696-99809d446d1b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $+$ | $-$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $-$ | $+$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149597/selection/46070df805b4653a5d877039a93fbcfb0cf7186aafc46672fa7e330153961054" :answer/id #uuid "0db77ca6-0e59-5961-ac00-9478f08ade21" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $-$ | $+$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $+$ | $-$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149597/selection/c8a570a7a45299d6bca7534749498af91d95f2281bdd8454030e707cf44ee838" :answer/id #uuid "461a96df-e50b-5dcc-80d7-243e8f4e2ff5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $+$ | $+$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $-$ | $-$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149597/selection/6ec7f55390e84a805c2f4b28c93f893967d5f7a64eeb901750d34dda29cf16f4" :answer/id #uuid "4183d7fa-eb95-5b2d-a3df-0fa9a6c2cb76" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $-$ | $-$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $+$ | $+$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149597/selection/e4d5cbdd1dc7cc0dd0fdf2a9056c717b9f60123484c35fc7a65c937abab9db2f" :answer/id #uuid "b1e6b329-9fa1-5539-b372-98ebcea005ae" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $+$ | $-$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $+$ | $-$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149597/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7d1bae80-eafe-5f18-a39b-a1aee84259d0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-149597/selection/e4d5cbdd1dc7cc0dd0fdf2a9056c717b9f60123484c35fc7a65c937abab9db2f" :answer-field/choices ["q-149597/selection/bab4acf5ca3a66ed4f11bbcf7574627e6848417923ee89f9393917451c190309" "q-149597/selection/46070df805b4653a5d877039a93fbcfb0cf7186aafc46672fa7e330153961054" "q-149597/selection/c8a570a7a45299d6bca75